[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3237835053","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110093#issuecomment-3237835053","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110093","id":3237835053,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7A_XEt","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-29T18:15:20Z","updated_at":"2025-08-29T18:15:20Z","body":"Window by default is focused on popup, try to use `w.unfocusable = true` in your code after initializing the window and it will not steal focus from the main window. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3237835053/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3237860237","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110093#issuecomment-3237860237","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110093","id":3237860237,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7A_dON","user":{"login":"twobitadder","id":90206015,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMjA2MDE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90206015?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/twobitadder","html_url":"https://github.com/twobitadder","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/twobitadder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/twobitadder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/twobitadder/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/twobitadder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/twobitadder/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/twobitadder/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/twobitadder/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/twobitadder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/twobitadder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-29T18:26:45Z","updated_at":"2025-08-29T18:30:05Z","body":"yep! that's in an edit and in the mrp - unfortunately i would like the window to take gui inputs when selected, which `unfocusable` completely shuts out as an option :/. there may be some more to a workaround involving manually enabling and disabling focusability, but i'd like to explore the behavior here first a little to see if it even is something that should be fixed before i go down that road.\n\ne: there may also be something here about my not fully understanding how to relinquish focus from a subwindow without disabling focus on it entirely, but regardless i think that the default behavior in the mrp is undesirable","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3237860237/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3237943375","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110093#issuecomment-3237943375","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110093","id":3237943375,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7A_xhP","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-29T19:02:36Z","updated_at":"2025-08-29T19:06:24Z","body":"Here's a script that allows you to focus a window when mouse enters, maybe we can add this as a Window flag `focus_on_mouse_enter`.\n\n```gdscript\nextends Area2D\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tinput_event.connect(test_input_event)\n\tget_tree().root.mouse_entered.connect(_mouse_entered)\n\n\nfunc _mouse_entered():\n\tget_tree().root.grab_focus()\n\n\nfunc test_input_event(_v : Viewport, e : InputEvent, _idx : int) -> void:\n\tif e is InputEventMouseMotion:\n\t\tprint(e.position)\n\t\n\tif e is InputEventMouseButton:\n\t\tif e.button_index == MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT && e.pressed:\n\t\t\tcreate_window(e.position)\n\n\nfunc _custom_window_mouse_entered(w: Window):\n\tw.grab_focus()\n\n\nfunc create_window(pos : Vector2) -> void:\n\tvar w : Window = Window.new()\n\tw.mouse_entered.connect(_custom_window_mouse_entered.bind(w))\n\tvar le : LineEdit = LineEdit.new()\n\t\n\t#uncomment the below line for input to work as normal on the area\n\t#w.unfocusable = true\n\t\n\tw.add_child(le)\n\tadd_child(w)\n\tw.popup()\n\tw.position = pos\n\tawait get_tree().process_frame\n\tawait get_tree().process_frame\n\tget_tree().root.grab_focus()\n\n```\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5594e7da-d65f-4566-a9f4-467db1bc36f1","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3237943375/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3237962553","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110093#issuecomment-3237962553","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110093","id":3237962553,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7A_2M5","user":{"login":"twobitadder","id":90206015,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMjA2MDE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90206015?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/twobitadder","html_url":"https://github.com/twobitadder","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/twobitadder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/twobitadder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/twobitadder/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/twobitadder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/twobitadder/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/twobitadder/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/u